    "image": "Photorealistic live-action 16:9 locked low night post-credits shot among the exact dark Dom Kultury rubble after everyone leaves. The tiny inert canonical 3 cm K20 lies half-buried near center. One battered dark work glove and dark green overshirt sleeve belonging to exact younger Mistrz Konca reaches from upper-right, fingers still several centimeters away. His tall stocky body is only a looming soft edge silhouette; a narrow fragment of jaw and watchful hazel eye may be caught in shadow. His clothing is ordinary practical RPG-player fieldwear, explicitly not Chaos cosplay; a folded scrap of plain dark fabric lies nearby with no symbol. Moon-blue light and faint natural green reflection from the die. No transformation, pulse, smile, villain pose, robes, helmet, extra hand, duplicate die, other person, text, UI, captions or watermark.",
